## 4. What remains open

The next challenge is to construct an explicit recursively enumerable physical theory and an arithmetic interpretation proving the required reflection implication. A second challenge is to replace the empty-world separation example with a nonempty operational semantics and jointly unrealizable finite constraints. See the [Stanford Encyclopedia discussion of scientific theories](https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/structure-scientific-theories/) for broader context.
